{
 "id": "fox-combo-shine",
 "name": "Shine out of combos",
 "part": "defense",
 "characters": [
  "fox"
 ],
 "goal": "Shine on the first frame after hitstun, between the hits of a string",
 "why": "A string that is not a true combo leaves a few frames in which Fox can act before the next hit. His shine hits on its first frame: started in that gap, it stops the string and turns it around.",
 "switch": "success",
 "reset": {
  "after": "quiet",
  "seconds": 1
 },
 "tutorial": {
  "what": "Take the jab, hold the stick down through the hitstun, and press B on the first frame Fox can act.",
  "expect": "Each string is judged when the shine hits, when the forward smash lands, or once the smash has missed: whether Fox shined, and how soon.",
  "example": [
   {
    "stick": [
     0,
     -1
    ],
    "frame": 2,
    "hold": 40,
    "from": "start"
   },
   {
    "press": "B",
    "frame": "FREE",
    "hold": 1,
    "from": "start"
   }
  ],
  "marks": {
   "1": "Frame 1: {opp}'s jab hits. Hitstun",
   "2": "Frame {f}: the stick down, held",
   "FREE": "Frame {FREE}: Fox can act. B: the shine"
  },
  "lessons": [
   {
    "title": "A string with a gap",
    "text": [
     "Not every string is a combo. {opp}'s jab leaves Fox in hitstun for a few frames; the forward smash after it lands on frame {SMASH}, and Fox can act on frame {FREE}.",
     "Whatever he starts in those {SMASH-FREE} frames comes before the smash, if it is fast enough."
    ],
    "show": {
     "example": {
      "inputs": [
       {
        "stick": [
         0,
         0
        ],
        "frame": 1,
        "hold": 1,
        "from": "start"
       }
      ],
      "marks": {
       "1": "Frame 1: {opp}'s jab hits. Hitstun",
       "FREE": "Frame {FREE}: Fox can act",
       "SMASH": "Frame {SMASH}: the smash lands"
      },
      "cues": [
       {
        "frames": [
         1,
         "FREE-1"
        ],
        "words": "Hitstun",
        "kind": "info"
       },
       {
        "frames": [
         "FREE",
         "SMASH-1"
        ],
        "words": "The gap: Fox can act",
        "kind": "go"
       },
       {
        "frames": [
         "SMASH",
         "SMASH+10"
        ],
        "words": "Hit again",
        "kind": "late"
       }
      ]
     }
    }
   },
   {
    "title": "The shine",
    "text": [
     "Down and B hits on its first frame, all around Fox: nothing else of his is out that fast.",
     "Hold the stick down through the hitstun and press B as it ends. A press during hitstun does nothing and is not kept: the press has to come on a frame Fox can act."
    ],
    "show": {
     "example": {
      "inputs": [
       {
        "stick": [
         0,
         -1
        ],
        "frame": 2,
        "hold": 40,
        "from": "start"
       },
       {
        "press": "B",
        "frame": "FREE",
        "hold": 1,
        "from": "start"
       }
      ],
      "marks": {
       "1": "Frame 1: {opp}'s jab hits. Hitstun",
       "2": "Frame {f}: the stick down, held",
       "FREE": "Frame {FREE}: Fox can act. B: the shine"
      },
      "cues": [
       {
        "frames": [
         1,
         "FREE-1"
        ],
        "words": "Hitstun: hold the stick down",
        "kind": "info"
       },
       {
        "frames": [
         "FREE",
         "FREE+5"
        ],
        "words": "B now: the shine",
        "kind": "go"
       },
       {
        "frames": [
         "FREE+6",
         "SMASH-1"
        ],
        "words": "The smash is coming",
        "kind": "late"
       }
      ]
     }
    }
   }
  ]
 },
